Package: aidia
Title: Adaptive Isolation for DIA - Your Aid for Window Optimization
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    person("Hayoung", "Lee", , "biryu32@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: AIDIA (Adaptive Isolation for DIA) aids researchers in optimizing
    Data-Independent Acquisition isolation windows for mass spectrometry.
    Features RT-dependent adaptive m/z range optimization with 5 strategies
    (Greedy, KDE, Quantile, Coverage, Outlier), 3 window modes
    (Variable, Fixed, Staggered), DPPP-based intelligent planning,
    duty cycle synchronization for parallel instruments, bootstrap boundary
    confidence intervals, 3 export formats (Thermo Xcalibur, Center Mass,
    m/z Range), technical replicate consensus handling, and an interactive
    Shiny dashboard. Optimized for Thermo Orbitrap instruments
    (Astral, Exploris, Fusion Lumos).
